## 4. Insertion Sort with Duplicate Elements

```python
nums = list(map(int, input("Enter numbers: ").split()))

for i in range(1, len(nums)):
    key = nums[i]
    j = i - 1

    while j >= 0 and nums[j] > key:
        nums[j + 1] = nums[j]
        j -= 1

    nums[j + 1] = key

print("Sorted Array:", nums)
```
